{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014vs6jbVnKhvWueyeEH4PW9","type":"tool_result","content":"319:pub const CONNECTION_ID_MAX_SIZE: usize = 20;\n321:/// Fixed-capacity QUIC connection ID.  C: `ConnectionId`.\n325:/// in many APIs (`get_local_connection_id`, `create_connection`,\n330:/// the C `compare_connection_id` shape: per-byte compare under\n333:pub struct ConnectionId {\n334:    id: [u8; CONNECTION_ID_MAX_SIZE],\n338:impl ConnectionId {\n340:    /// when `bytes.len()` exceeds [`CONNECTION_ID_MAX_SIZE`].\n342:        if bytes.len() > CONNECTION_ID_MAX_SIZE {\n345:        let mut id = [0u8; CONNECTION_ID_MAX_SIZE];\n354:    /// Returns `None` when `len` exceeds [`CONNECTION_ID_MAX_SIZE`].\n356:        if len > CONNECTION_ID_MAX_SIZE {\n360:            id: [0u8; CONNECTION_ID_MAX_SIZE],\n381:    /// `is_connection_id_null` sentinel check.\n386:    /// Hash with a 16-byte seed.  C: `connection_id_hash`.\n392:    /// C: `val64_connection_id`.\n539:/// Folds the C `void* connection_id_cb_data` into the implementor's state.\n540:/// C: `ConnectionIdCallback`.\n541:pub trait ConnectionIdCallback {\n545:        connection_id_local: ConnectionId,\n546:        connection_id_remote: ConnectionId,\n547:    ) -> ConnectionId;\n1135:    /// * `connection_id_callback` + `connection_id_callback_data` collapse to\n1136:    ///   `Option<Box<dyn ConnectionIdCallback>>`.\n1155:        cnx_id_callback: Option<Box<dyn ConnectionIdCallback>>,\n1237:            local_connection_id_length: 8,\n1240:            local_connection_id_ttl: u64::MAX,\n1303:            connection_id_callback_fn: cnx_id_callback,\n1304:            connection_id_callback_ctx: None,\n1447:                tp.active_connection_id_limit = tp_value as u32;","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FNJRg8YhsoxF5PXikNyYX1","session_id":"6e30a456-15c0-4e3c-af27-9f4dab375915","uuid":"7c620d08-e29d-4988-ba49-d3fa63727e97","timestamp":"2026-05-05T21:49:06.770Z"}
