{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RuCeFeuB9z2ZmZjbnK9RUe","type":"tool_result","content":"1799\t    pub fn connection_ref_by_id(&mut self, id: ConnectionId) -> Option<&mut Connection> {\n1800\t        let ht = self.connection_by_id.lookup(&id)?;\n1801\t        let conn_token = *self.connection_by_id.get(ht)?;\n1802\t        self.connections.get_mut(conn_token)\n1803\t    }\n1804\t\n1805\t    /// Convenience wrapper around [`Self::create_connection`] for the\n1806\t    /// client side; `addr` is required.\n1807\t    pub fn create_client_connection(\n1808\t        &mut self,\n1809\t        addr: &SocketAddr,\n1810\t        start_time: Instant,\n1811\t        preferred_version: u32,\n1812\t        sni: Option<&str>,\n1813\t        alpn: Option<&str>,\n1814\t        _callback: Option<Box<dyn StreamDataCallback>>,\n1815\t    ) -> Option<&mut Connection> {\n1816\t        // Client connections use a null initial local CID and the server address.\n1817\t        // Delegates to create_connection which delegates to create_cnx_internal.\n1818\t        // SKIP: TLS not yet wired; returns None from create_cnx_internal.\n1819\t        self.create_connection(\n1820\t            ConnectionId::with_size(0)?,\n1821\t            ConnectionId::with_size(0)?,\n1822\t            Some(addr),\n1823\t            start_time,"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FNJRg8YhsoxF5PXikNyYX1","session_id":"6e30a456-15c0-4e3c-af27-9f4dab375915","uuid":"36d98f10-f7b8-48a7-9cac-7f8ec7b02170","timestamp":"2026-05-05T22:00:49.134Z"}
